    "detailed_description": "A horror adventure game where a girl, who cares deeply for her best friend, searches for her friend in an aquarium turned into a world of terror. While escaping from strange beings called Creepy, you will unravel the mysteries hidden in the aquarium.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe horror elements are mild, allowing you to enjoy challenging puzzles. In addition to the protagonist, unique and charming girls will appear. The story features multiple endings that change based on your choices.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe playtime is approximately 3 hours.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is created with RPG Maker MZ.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nZ key: Confirm, fast forward<br />\r\nX key: Open menu, cancel<br />\r\nArrow keys: Move character<br />\r\nShift key: Dash<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game supports Japanese, Korean, and Chinese (Simplified and Traditional).",
    "about_the_game": "A horror adventure game where a girl, who cares deeply for her best friend, searches for her friend in an aquarium turned into a world of terror. While escaping from strange beings called Creepy, you will unravel the mysteries hidden in the aquarium.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe horror elements are mild, allowing you to enjoy challenging puzzles. In addition to the protagonist, unique and charming girls will appear. The story features multiple endings that change based on your choices.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe playtime is approximately 3 hours.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is created with RPG Maker MZ.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nZ key: Confirm, fast forward<br />\r\nX key: Open menu, cancel<br />\r\nArrow keys: Move character<br />\r\nShift key: Dash<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game supports Japanese, Korean, and Chinese (Simplified and Traditional).",
    "short_description": "This is a horror adventure game where a girl, devoted to her best friend, searches for her companion in an aquarium that has transformed into a world of horror. While evading the deformed entities known as &quot;Creepies,&quot; the player must unravel the mysteries concealed within the aquarium.",
